[I] Fast math parser library

[T] muparser is a fast mathematical expression parser library written in
[T] C++. It parses and evaluates expressions given as strings at runtime,
[T] using bytecode compilation for speed, and supports user-defined
[T] variables, constants, functions and operators.

[U] https://beltoforion.de/en/muparser/

[A] Muparser Authors
